.env*
# ...but the example is part of the image: the root Dockerfile COPYs it, and
# `.env*` above silently excluded it, so `docker compose up --build` failed at
# that COPY with "/.env.example: not found" before it reached anything else.
!.env.example
config.yaml
config.*.yaml
!config.example.yaml
.codex
.claude
.idea
.junie

# Docker files
Dockerfile*
tmp
coordinare.state.json
